# Aggregating Events

Analysts often summarize activity to identify patterns.

Example:

```kusto
MeridianLogs_CL
| summarize FailedAttempts = count() by SourceIP
```

This query helps identify systems generating excessive authentication failures.

---

# Building Detection Logic

A common brute-force detection might be:

```kusto
MeridianLogs_CL
| where RawData has "Failed password"
| extend SourceIP = extract(@"from ([0-9.]+)",1,RawData)
| summarize Attempts = count() by SourceIP
| where Attempts > 5
| order by Attempts desc
```

This logic can be used directly in a Microsoft Sentinel Analytics Rule.

